hat they're  saying I did if I'm going to prison then  I'm going down biting  I'm going down telling my side of the  story  security cameras are everywhere you can  see Aaron Moriarty's report Melissa  Turner's closing act on 48 hours that's  tomorrow night at 10 9 Central right  here on CBS and on our streaming service  that's Paramount Plus
 

